   "t": 65.5,
   "fen": "rnbqkb1r/pp1ppppp/8/3nP3/3p4/2P5/PP3PPP/RNBQKBNR w KQkq - 1 5",
   "line": [
    "Nd5"
   ],
   "spoken": "After the pawn to e5 and the knight to d5, the position is a normal Alapin Sicilian — comfortable and low-risk for Black, with none of the Morra's initiative to fear.",
